sentences.text:
It is ordered that the accused-petitioner(s) Sandeep Maheshwari S/o Shri Babulal Maheshwari in F.I.R. No.411/2017, registered at Police Station Udyog Nagar, District Kota, shall be released on bail;
provided he furnishe(s) a personal bond of Rs.1,00,000/- with two surety bonds of Rs.50,000/-
each to the satisfaction of the learned trial court with the stipulation to appear before that Court on all dates of hearing and as and when called upon to do so.

